(5876249, 854333, 49716, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W treatment and framing.  If the contrast was a bit stonger and the toe caps were in focus it would be even better for me.</td>', 'I like the B&W treatment and framing.  If the contrast was a bit stonger and the toe caps were in focus it would be even better for me.', '2010-02-22 07:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
