(5876271, 855767, 49716, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Maybe it is the ''letterbox'' but it has a cinema-graphic feel to it.</td>', 'I like this.  Maybe it is the ''letterbox'' but it has a cinema-graphic feel to it.', '2010-02-22 07:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
