(5876273, 855339, 49716, '<td valign="top">Good energy in this image.  It woulod be even better for me if he wasn''t wearing shoes, but maybe that wasn''t the point of the shot.</td>', 'Good energy in this image.  It woulod be even better for me if he wasn''t wearing shoes, but maybe that wasn''t the point of the shot.', '2010-02-22 07:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
