(5876306, 855457, 63398, '<td valign="top">I''m going to give you an 9 for unique creativity, but I had to work really hard to figure this out. I had to Google the phrase, then I still couldn''t see the shoe once I looked at it again. Finally....I saw it! Very well done, unique &amp; creative, but I''ll be surprised if you don''t get slammed by this crowd.....8&gt;).....Good luck!</td>', 'I''m going to give you an 9 for unique creativity, but I had to work really hard to figure this out. I had to Google the phrase, then I still couldn''t see the shoe once I looked at it again. Finally....I saw it! Very well done, unique & creative, but I''ll be surprised if you don''t get slammed by this crowd.....8>).....Good luck!', '2010-02-22 08:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
