(5876659, 854906, 109541, '<td valign="top">Idea pretty good, it looks like this photo had a lot of sharpening applied to a not so sharp photo.  Might just be me.   Lot''s of overexposure on the top shelf.  Try an off camera directional flash pointed into the middle of the shoe rack.  Drop you aperture to the smallest you can get to get some natural sharpening (better depth of field).</td>', 'Idea pretty good, it looks like this photo had a lot of sharpening applied to a not so sharp photo.  Might just be me.   Lot''s of overexposure on the top shelf.  Try an off camera directional flash pointed into the middle of the shoe rack.  Drop you aperture to the smallest you can get to get some natural sharpening (better depth of field).', '2010-02-22 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
