(5876978, 855667, 51793, '<td valign="top">I like the details in the boots and the reflection off the top of the car but I don''t like how busy the background it. It looks like a garage full of things other than items that have to do with the boots. It''s just a bit distracting IMO but it''s still a good picture.</td>', 'I like the details in the boots and the reflection off the top of the car but I don''t like how busy the background it. It looks like a garage full of things other than items that have to do with the boots. It''s just a bit distracting IMO but it''s still a good picture.', '2010-02-22 17:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5877045, 854906, 10785, '<td valign="top">A very creative idea to show a womans world of shoe choices! My wife would admire the collection. I voted this photograph pretty low and just wanted to give some constructve criticism to help explain why. There seems to be some issues with the exposure. There are very dark shoes where the details were lost and very light shoes where there are no details either. I am assuming this was shot with an on camera flash because the lighting is very bright in the middle of the photo and very dark around the edges. I would prefer to see a softer diffuse lighting. Perhaps putting some white translucent paper in front of the flash could help it to be less direct. Also there just seems to be some problems with the clarity of the photo. It doesn''t seem to be in focus at all. It may be due to camera shake, being handheld or just missing the focus. One good thing about the photo is the color seems to be spot on. Nice shades of red, blue and tans/browns/golds. Hope you had a good ime with the challenge.</td>', 'A very creative idea to show a womans world of shoe choices! My wife would admire the collection. I voted this photograph pretty low and just wanted to give some constructve criticism to help explain why. There seems to be some issues with the exposure. There are very dark shoes where the details were lost and very light shoes where there are no details either. I am assuming this was shot with an on camera flash because the lighting is very bright in the middle of the photo and very dark around the edges. I would prefer to see a softer diffuse lighting. Perhaps putting some white translucent paper in front of the flash could help it to be less direct. Also there just seems to be some problems with the clarity of the photo. It doesn''t seem to be in focus at all. It may be due to camera shake, being handheld or just missing the focus. One good thing about the photo is the color seems to be spot on. Nice shades of red, blue and tans/browns/golds. Hope you had a good ime with the challenge.', '2010-02-22 18:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5877048, 855836, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a good close up shot to show off the texture of the slippers. However if it wasn''t mentioned in the title I would know this was slippers. It could have been a purple muppet or something. I think you just got up too close with this composition.</td>', 'This is a good close up shot to show off the texture of the slippers. However if it wasn''t mentioned in the title I would know this was slippers. It could have been a purple muppet or something. I think you just got up too close with this composition.', '2010-02-22 18:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
