(5877051, 854469, 10785, '<td valign="top">Huge boot collection! I think the white balance setting is off on this image. It seems to have a yellow/orange tint to it possibly due to tungsten lighting. It also seems to suffer from image grain due to the low light conditions.</td>', 'Huge boot collection! I think the white balance setting is off on this image. It seems to have a yellow/orange tint to it possibly due to tungsten lighting. It also seems to suffer from image grain due to the low light conditions.', '2010-02-22 18:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
