(5880960, 855597, 51793, '<td valign="top">Although this is a neat idea, the lighting and focus are off. With this being an advanced editing challenge I think you should have corrected the orange tint on the arms, the blueish tint on the face, the blue on the shoes and remove the watch. <br/> <br/>I also think you should have cropped this to remove the crotch, or at least sat a different way. <br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Although this is a neat idea, the lighting and focus are off. With this being an advanced editing challenge I think you should have corrected the orange tint on the arms, the blueish tint on the face, the blue on the shoes and remove the watch.  I also think you should have cropped this to remove the crotch, or at least sat a different way.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2010-02-25 16:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
