(5882299, 855371, 811, '<td valign="top">i honestly think my head is just slightly crooked, so take this for what it is worth, but it honestly looks like this is tilted ever so slightly to the right.  i seem to say that a lot, so i''m seriously starting to think my eyes are just crooked or something.  or maybe i''m just dizzy or something.  otherwise, i''m guessing idnic -- these shoes look like some she would wear/own.  :P</td>', 'i honestly think my head is just slightly crooked, so take this for what it is worth, but it honestly looks like this is tilted ever so slightly to the right.  i seem to say that a lot, so i''m seriously starting to think my eyes are just crooked or something.  or maybe i''m just dizzy or something.  otherwise, i''m guessing idnic -- these shoes look like some she would wear/own.  :P', '2010-02-26 23:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
