(5883747, 854906, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty blurry and some washed out highlights as well. I think  the idea has a lot of potential, but there''s not much that can be done for this shot. Looks like there may have been some use of onboard flash for this. Forward facing onboard flash rarely provides a good look to a shot. Using a tripod to stabilize the camera and shooting using some off camera light could possibly help. Sorry to be so harsh.</td>', 'Looks pretty blurry and some washed out highlights as well. I think  the idea has a lot of potential, but there''s not much that can be done for this shot. Looks like there may have been some use of onboard flash for this. Forward facing onboard flash rarely provides a good look to a shot. Using a tripod to stabilize the camera and shooting using some off camera light could possibly help. Sorry to be so harsh.', '2010-02-28 19:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
