(5884068, 855267, 109227, '<td valign="top">Wow - thanks for all the votes and positive comments.  My first challenge and I am thrilled.  The boots belong to my husband who wore them in Iraq.  One dogtag is worn traditionally around the neck and the other laced into the boot by most troops in a war zone; the boots are just as they were when he came home.  He is home safe.  I will pass along your kind words.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-01 00:36:05.</i></td>', 'Wow - thanks for all the votes and positive comments.  My first challenge and I am thrilled.  The boots belong to my husband who wore them in Iraq.  One dogtag is worn traditionally around the neck and the other laced into the boot by most troops in a war zone; the boots are just as they were when he came home.  He is home safe.  I will pass along your kind words.', '2010-03-01 00:20:31.000000', '2010-03-01 00:36:05.000000', 0),
(5884070, 855721, 63398, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a lovely image and fine finish. It''s a red-letter day for me to finish higher than you in a challenge!</td>', 'Congrats on a lovely image and fine finish. It''s a red-letter day for me to finish higher than you in a challenge!', '2010-03-01 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
