(5889315, 855598, 109341, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the kind comments.  I really appreciate it.</td>', 'Thank you all for the kind comments.  I really appreciate it.', '2010-03-03 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889452, 855360, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. My only suggestion is to get in tighter and really focus in on the hands and laces.  Pretty much just hands, shoe, and laces in the frame. <br/> <br/>I find that when selective desaturation is used its best if what is left in color takes up a significant portion of the frame. Naturally there are exceptions to this but generally... :)</td>', 'Nice shot. My only suggestion is to get in tighter and really focus in on the hands and laces.  Pretty much just hands, shoe, and laces in the frame.  I find that when selective desaturation is used its best if what is left in color takes up a significant portion of the frame. Naturally there are exceptions to this but generally... :)', '2010-03-03 21:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889471, 855176, 54645, '<td valign="top">Oh man, this is fantastic, great humor.</td>', 'Oh man, this is fantastic, great humor.', '2010-03-03 21:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889492, 855851, 100831, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the DQ - I can''t see what the big deal is but I guess rules are rules (unless we want to try and change them).</td>', 'Sorry about the DQ - I can''t see what the big deal is but I guess rules are rules (unless we want to try and change them).', '2010-03-03 21:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889502, 855457, 18367, '<td valign="top">First of all I would like to thank Magnum_za for bringing to my attention that I am an imbecile, as I am one of those people who dared vote this a sub 5 image.<br/> <br/>My reasons for doing so have nothing to do with my not seeing the shape of a shoe in an image.  Also, considering that I am fully bilingual, the title alone would have brought to my attention the fact that the shoe image consisted of strategically placed flowers.<br/> <br/>It is a quantum leap to assume that all I did was "Look, assume, vote and move on" as I can assure you that I make several passes whenever I vote on images.<br/> <br/>I voted this image a 4, which I earnestly believed was what it merited.  Some may not like it, but it is my vote and no amount of finger pointing or name calling will get me to alter my decision... a decision that I rendered after a careful consideration.<br/> <br/>The image was indeed innovative, creative and something out of the normal interpretation... unfortunately it was not all that well done, hence my decision for scoring it the way I did.<br/> <br/>Did the image merit 19 scores of one... apparently yes in the views of those who doled those scores out, just as others earnestly believed the image merited scores of 7 to 10.<br/> <br/>Probably the most important facet of being on this site is the learning experience, and improving one''s skills is or should be the primary objectives for all.<br/> <br/>Virtual ribbons are a fleeting thing.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'First of all I would like to thank Magnum_za for bringing to my attention that I am an imbecile, as I am one of those people who dared vote this a sub 5 image. My reasons for doing so have nothing to do with my not seeing the shape of a shoe in an image.  Also, considering that I am fully bilingual, the title alone would have brought to my attention the fact that the shoe image consisted of strategically placed flowers. It is a quantum leap to assume that all I did was "Look, assume, vote and move on" as I can assure you that I make several passes whenever I vote on images. I voted this image a 4, which I earnestly believed was what it merited.  Some may not like it, but it is my vote and no amount of finger pointing or name calling will get me to alter my decision... a decision that I rendered after a careful consideration. The image was indeed innovative, creative and something out of the normal interpretation... unfortunately it was not all that well done, hence my decision for scoring it the way I did. Did the image merit 19 scores of one... apparently yes in the views of those who doled those scores out, just as others earnestly believed the image merited scores of 7 to 10. Probably the most important facet of being on this site is the learning experience, and improving one''s skills is or should be the primary objectives for all. Virtual ribbons are a fleeting thing. Ray', '2010-03-03 21:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889592, 855474, 109541, '<td valign="top">Just figuring out how to use the reply.  Thank you very much for your comment.  And thanks for taking the time to write something.</td>', 'Just figuring out how to use the reply.  Thank you very much for your comment.  And thanks for taking the time to write something.', '2010-03-03 22:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889707, 855457, 51747, '<td valign="top">One of your 9''s. Loved the idea and it''s a very appealing image. I would be upset by the many low votes too. Chin up!</td>', 'One of your 9''s. Loved the idea and it''s a very appealing image. I would be upset by the many low votes too. Chin up!', '2010-03-04 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
